{"lines":[{"id":"s1","text":"Put the plate back?|Never. It's yours."},{"id":"s2","text":"All froze.|Wrong way."},{"id":"s3","text":"Put it back?|Never."},{"id":"s4","text":"Same plate.|New move."},{"id":"s5","text":"Keep it.|Order more."},{"id":"s6","text":"He called out—"},{"id":"s7","text":"Belt keeps turning.|Plates keep coming."},{"id":"s8","text":"Eat up.|Enjoy it."},{"id":"s9","text":"Touch it, it's yours.|No take-backs."},{"id":"n1","text":"The plate is yours.|The moment you touch it."},{"id":"n2","text":"Want more?|Order on the screen."},{"id":"n3","text":"Cameras watch the belt.|Don't touch twice."},{"id":"n4","text":"That's Japan first times.|Follow for more."}],"rate":"+8%","voice":"en-US-GuyNeural"}